    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper class to manipulate <computeroutput>!mmra</computeroutput> metadata nodes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This can be visualized as a set of &quot;tags&quot;, with each tag representing a particular property of an instruction, as explained in the MemoryModelRelaxationAnnotations docs.</para>
<para>This class (and the optimizer in general) does not reason about the exact nature of the tags and the properties they imply. It just sees the metadata as a collection of tags, which are a prefix/suffix pair of strings. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
